      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "It is important to know child bruxism symptomatology and etiology. It will allow diagnosis by simple endo and exo oral examination, in deciduous and mixte denture. Early treatment of bruxism can then be established, preserving integrity of permanent denture."},
